    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 1 — Rosicrucian</strong></p><p><strong>“The secret isn’t the symbol. It’s the route.”</strong></p><p>You become a bearer of old codes and practical protocols. You know how to talk to people who do not want to be found — and how to survive when they find you first.</p><p><strong>Tactical (Character Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>Gain a skill rank in <strong>Lore</strong> and <strong>Diplomacy</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Strategic (Faction Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>When your faction negotiates treaties, ceasefires, trade pacts, or alliances, gain <strong>+1 to the relevant Diplomacy OP roll</strong></li><li>You begin play with one established positive relationship with a neutral NPC faction (GM chooses or you propose)</li></ul><p><strong>Cost:</strong> every functioning backchannel creates expectations. Old contacts become live liabilities the moment you prove the network still works.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
